s","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","review_id":"YqdZiOnROoY-sfwHctlm4A","date":"2020-07-18T21:03:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9071948528289795,"text_excerpt":"Really great snowball shop! These are not your average snowballs, these are designer snowballs. While they do have regular snowballs if you go to sweet thangs you have to get the designer snowball! I got the dreamsicle flavor and it came with orange cream snowballs, whipped cream, and a dreamsicle popsicle. It was delicious and very refreshing on a hot summer day. My boyfriend got the strawberry cheesecake snowball which is their most popular. It was a strawberry cheesecake snowball flavor with a slice of cheesecake! These snowballs are $8 but completely worth it and the most instagrammable snowball you'll find! Definitely try them out this summer!"},{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","review_id":"sOb1QQCYEsiBUy-03kemeA","date":"2021-08-06T14:54:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8989012241363525,"text_excerpt":"Nice snowball stand with outdoor area to enjoy your snacks. This shop serves snowballs and snacks. I tried the nachos and the strawberry cheesecake snowball. I wanted to try a designer snowball but the one I wanted wasn't available at the time. Everything I had was great. It was nice to have an order area to sit and eat my snacks although there were lots of flies around us. I want to go back to try a designer snowball."},{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","review_id":"TMXqQjAIIVedbH9UyA3Ujw","date":"2020-09-01T16:59:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8917539119720459,"text_excerpt":"Pffft Willy Wonka has nothing on Sweet Thangs. Now lemme tell y'all--when I went to Sweet Thangs, I had every intentions of sharing my order with my friend after my visit. Welp, the lie detector test came back and that was a lie. I hogged the whole order and selfishly didn't care one bit. How does one enjoy two designer snoballs and an order of their crawfish nachos? You interchange between sips and bites of the snoballs and take a break with a nacho chip. 2 Snoballs, 1 Nacho. I'll be honest, I had always passed by Sweet Thangs and figured it was a mini food truck lot but I was wrong. The whole lot is Sweet Thangs! It not only houses their food truck for mobile parties and such; however, ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","photo_id":"ACEfsfO09pXhQXocuTkQCA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ACEfsfO09pXhQXocuTkQCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9111102223396301},{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","photo_id":"CKscem5w520t4q5PpOEuRA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CKscem5w520t4q5PpOEuRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8381333947181702},{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","photo_id":"W3UpSi2bE2F71W6KrW_N-w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/W3UpSi2bE2F71W6KrW_N-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8034297227859497},{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","photo_id":"xvb5eP1VZoWZHS7yro9wBg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xvb5eP1VZoWZHS7yro9wBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7838994264602661},{"business_id":"YTpfqZ2P4MRg19J7iVxarQ","photo_id":"bw9Cn19HxybfGjQGys8Gow","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bw9Cn19HxybfGjQGys8Gow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7756102681159973}]},"notebook_case":null}
